70010000076216.description:
You will take on the role of a fearless courier who quickly and dexterously overcomes the urban jungle on his bike. Explore various areas of the city, from densely populated streets to branching alleys. Each delivery is a new opportunity to test your navigation and route planning skills.

Be careful and avoid collisions, because falling off your bike can cost you precious time! Accelerate as much as possible, but remember about safety! Your speed can help you deliver the order on time, but do not forget to maneuver carefully to avoid accidents.

Get ready for a bike adventure where speed and caution go hand in hand. Test your skills and become the best courier in the city!

GAME FEATURES:
• A great warm-up for agility and attentiveness;
• Many missions with varying difficulty;

70010000077172.description:
You play as Seiji Maruyama, a middle-aged yakuza recently released from prison. Old tropes are here but you can choose to not follow them. The question is — does anything really matter that much now?

The game features:
- Multi-endings;
- Complex beat'em up action;
- Mini-games;
- City to explore.

70010000078552.description:
Get ready for an exciting basketball adventure! Test your skills and become a long shot master in this addictive game.

Your goal is simple: throw the ball into the basket. But don't let the simplicity fool you! With each level, the difficulty will increase, requiring more and more accuracy and skill from you. Test your skills on various stages, each of which presents a unique set of obstacles. As you progress through the game, your skill will increase and you will be able to perform increasingly difficult shots.

Experience the thrill of shooting the ball like never before and become a basketball legend. Get ready for an exciting adventure that will test your skills and provide hours of addictive gameplay!

GAME FEATURES:
• Excellent warm-up for accuracy;
• Many levels of varying difficulty;
• Realistic physics of ball behavior;
• Simple and minimalistic graphics;

70010000078559.description:
An addictive game that allows the player to enjoy the classic air hockey game anytime, anywhere!

The player controls his puck, trying to score it into the opponent's goal, using his lightning-fast reflexes and strategic thinking. The game offers several difficulty levels so that everyone can choose their own level and enjoy the game to the fullest. The player can play both against the computer and against a friend on the same device.

For each victory, the player receives coins that can be spent on customizing the playing field. The player can choose the background, pucks and other elements to make the game more personal and unique.

GAME FEATURES:
• Various modes with different AI difficulties;
• Ability to play together on one device;
• Huge selection of customization for the appearance of the game;

70010000079625.description:
DUNGEON ARSENAL is a fast-paced roguelike card game. Go through series of random-generated floors filled with cards for you to reveal. The weapons and items you need for your journey will be among those cards, however, terrible monsters are also waiting to be revealed... Choose your Hero and good luck!

Search each floor for weapons, items and gold;
Enemies are also among the cards you find on each floor... be careful;
Find the best strategy to safely advance through the random-generated floors;
Find Treasure Rooms, filled with gold and a special Relic that grants you a special skill;
Buy stronger weapon cards and exclusive Relics at shops;
Defeat bosses at the end of each section;
Unlock new Heroes and cards;
Unlock alternate versions and card borders for your favorite Heroes;
Choose between 4 difficulty levels, each one with unique features and challenges;

70010000080278.description:
An abandoned house, a locked room, somewhere in the distance you hear the steps of your kidnapper... How to escape? You'll have to secretly explore the house, find hidden objects and use them to escape from the maniac!

Be extremely careful and act quietly so as not to attract the attention of a maniac. Your footsteps, the creaking of doors or the noise of an accidentally dropped mug can attract the attention of your kidnapper. Sneak like a shadow, collect various tools to open locked boxes and hiding places and find your way to the exit!

You have several attempts, so try not to get caught by the maniac. Can you find the path to freedom?

GAME FEATURES:
• The heart-stopping genre of escape from a maniac;
• Detailed levels with puzzles;
• Fun and addictive escape gameplay;
• Intense and atmospheric soundtrack;

70010000080658.description:
A dynamic action game that immerses the player in the world of tank battles. Take command of a powerful tank and go on exciting missions full of dangers!

Each level is a unique battlefield where the player will have to perform a variety of combat missions. During these missions you will face different types of enemies: from lightly armored vehicles to heavy assault tanks. Plan your attacks, use cover, strategically maneuver and destroy your enemies to achieve victory on every battlefield.

Fight against numerous opponents, complete difficult tasks and prove that you are the real hero of the armored forces!

GAME FEATURES:
• Stylized cartoon graphics;
• Many levels with varying difficulty;
• Exciting gameplay for fans of tank battles;
• Atmospheric sound;

70010000080966.description:
The goal of the game is simple - deliver various cargo to the desired point and complete tasks. But be extremely careful - the load may be unstable and fragile!

The game has many different tasks with different levels of difficulty - from the simplest with light and small loads to complex with bulky and fragile loads.

Plunge into a real challenge for fans of work transport simulators and transport all the cargo!

GAME FEATURES:
- Realistic physics and forklift control system;
- Lots of different tasks;
- Many different types of cargo;
- Realistic sounds;

70010000080998.description:
Choose one of three unique heroes and go to exciting levels filled with a variety of enemies - from ordinary ordinary soldiers to huge and difficult bosses! To defeat enemies, the player is given a wide arsenal of weapons, which can be unlocked and upgraded as the game progresses. Defeat enemies, earn gold and upgrade your guns!

Each level presents a new challenge, requiring the player's tactical thinking, reaction and skill. With each victory, the player gets the opportunity to improve his character and expand his arsenal of weapons, which helps him cope with more difficult challenges.

Immerse yourself in exciting gameplay, dynamic combat and unforgettable enemy battles, making each playthrough a unique and exciting adventure!

GAME FEATURES:
• Top-down shooter genre for those who like to test their accuracy and reaction;
• Many levels with varying difficulty and a variety of enemies;
• Dynamic and fun gameplay that doesn’t let you get bored;

70010000081026.description:
The player finds himself in a mysterious maze. The player's goal is to find a way out of this dark place by solving riddles, collecting items and avoiding dangerous monsters lurking around every corner.

Players will explore labyrinthine corridors and rooms that constantly change and mysteriously take them to new places. Their lives will be threatened by various dangers, from monsters to traps and riddles that must be solved in order to move forward.

Risk, tension and an atmosphere of mystery pose a real challenge for fans of horror games.

GAME FEATURES:
• An escape simulator that constantly keeps you on your toes;
• Many labyrinths of varying complexity;
• Heartbreaking atmosphere of liminal spaces;
• Excellent warm-up for the mind and attentiveness;

70010000081619.description:
Five different sceneries, a hundred kittens to rescue in each, and only one person to take care of it all. (That person is you!)

Keep your eyes open for ears, tails and noses - kittens are small, and there's a lot of them around ^^

Features:
- Original soundtrack;
- 5 different scenarios;
- 505 cats to find;
- 5 special cats with personal rescue stories!
- Game experience designed for a bit of thought and relaxation ^^

70010000081770.description:
Is it just me, or are those... pawprints all over the streets of Rome? And where there’s pawprints, there’s cats! Let's search for them!

Hidden Cats in Rome is a short and pleasant hidden objects game for everyone – look around a big, lovely illustration, relax, and spot all the furry friends hiding in every nook and cranny. Starting with a beautiful (yet monochromatic) scenery, the city fills itself with warm colours the more cats you find!

Features:
- Gorgeous hand-drawn sceneries to look around;
- Two main game modes, one more challenging than the other;
- Extra unlockable stages with little kittens!;
- Relaxing music and ambient;
- Over 900 cats… and other things to find :)

70010000083270.description:
Chessarama is a collection of original puzzle and strategy games inspired by Chess. It reimagines chess rules and tactics using many different themes. Each game has its own set of rules, visual theme and original handcrafted challenges for you to play!

Here are all the original games you will find in Chessarama: (1) Farm Life; (2) Dragon Slayers; (3) Street Soccer; (4) Lady Ronin; (5) Last Stand; (6) Knight Supreme; (7) Pawn Mania; (8) Soccer Chess.

Take a look at some of the Chessarama games:

In Dragon Slayer, you need to push your pawn to the end of a path in order to kill the mighty dragon. But it will not be that easy! The dragon attacks the board every time the pawn moves and every undefended piece will die.

In Lady Ronin, Chess meets Sokoban. You play with a Ronin (a chess queen) and you need to eliminate the other pieces in order to get close to the Shogun and kill it. Pieces move like in chess, but push each other like in sokoban.

In Soccer Chess you will play a soccer match using chess pieces. You will need to think a few moves ahead if you want to break through the adversary's defenses to score a goal.

This is just some examples about how Chess can be reinvented. Welcome to Chessarama!

*Play 8 exclusive chess-inspired games available in Chessarama;
*Puzzle campaigns featuring 100+ levels plus 100+ unique challenges;
*24 exclusive Chess Figures to unlock and collect;
*Unique art style, with beautiful dioramas;
*Daily and Weekly Challenges;
*Compete against each other on the leaderboards;
*Learn chess movements, tactics and strategies through a modern video game experience;
*Also includes “Classic Chess” for you to put your learnings into practice!

70010000083444.description:
Your task is to color a variety of images using a wide range of tools and a palette of bright colors. The game offers many different pictures to color - choose the images to your liking and start the creative process!

You have a whole arsenal of drawing and coloring tools at your disposal. Each tool can be adjusted in thickness and intensity, allowing you to achieve the desired effect and make your work unique.

This is not only a fun activity, but also a great opportunity to relax and relieve stress. Immerse yourself in a world of colors and fantasy and create your own masterpieces. No matter your skill level, this game will provide you with hours of fun and inspiration!

GAME FEATURES:
• A game for creativity, fantasy and self-expression;
• Many options for images for coloring;
• Relaxing gameplay will allow you to take a break from all your problems;
• A pleasant soundtrack will immerse you in the magical world of colors!

70010000084040.description:
You take on the role of an elite agent of a special unit fighting terrorism around the world. Your mission is to eliminate dangerous enemies, free hostages and defuse deadly bombs to ensure safety and peace.

Each mission is a unique challenge that requires you to think strategically, accurately and quickly. You'll infiltrate fortified terrorist bases, liberate captured buildings, and neutralize threats in environments ranging from city streets to remote desert camps.

Your arsenal includes a wide range of weapons and equipment. Improve your skills and equipment to become even more effective in the fight against terrorists. Use tactics, coordinate your actions and make quick decisions to successfully complete each mission and save innocent lives.

GAME FEATURES:
- Dynamic first-person shooter gameplay;
- Special missions of varying complexity;
- Large arsenal of various weapons and equipment;

70010000084045.description:
The gameplay is very simple and intuitive - you need to use logic and attention to correctly collect the fruits in the jar. When you drop the same fruits next to each other, they combine into a new fruit of a more valuable type, bringing you additional points. Collect fruits of the same color, combine them to get new combinations and increased points. Each successful combination brings you closer to the level goal and adds sweet pleasure to your collection!

In each level, you will have to solve various puzzles and tasks, using your intuition and creativity. Remove fruits of the same color, combine them to get new combinations and increased points. Each successful combination brings you closer to the level goal and adds sweet pleasure to your collection!

GAME FEATURES
• A great workout for the mind and logic;
• Many levels with varying difficulty;
• Relaxing music;

70010000084853.description:
You will find yourself in the role of a police driver who will have to demonstrate his parking skills by driving a variety of police vehicles. Your task is to properly park official vehicles in various conditions and locations, from quiet deserted parking lots to busy streets full of other cars and obstacles.

Each mission offers unique challenges: you'll need to maneuver through narrow passages, watch out for moving vehicles, and find the optimal parking spot. Be careful and use all available skills to successfully complete each task.

The game provides a wide selection of police vehicles. Each type of transport has its own control features that need to be taken into account when parking. You'll have to adapt to different sizes and driving styles to cope with the challenges and become a true parking master!

GAME FEATURES:
• Realistic physics of driving;
• Many levels with varying difficulty;
• Huge selection of various service vehicles;

70010000085685.description:
Experience the ultimate drift racing sensation in Drift Legends 2, the second installment of the incredibly realistic 3D drifting game. Take control of highly-detailed legendary drift cars and conquer various tracks as you strive to break records. Progress from a novice to a professional drift driver. 

FEATURES:
- Realistic physics, simulating every aspect of car behaviour;
- Drive more than 40 powerful and exciting, highly detailed drifting cars;
- Drift on detailed tracks with different layouts;
- Career mode allows you to get more experience, complete achievements and unlock powerful secret cars;
- Every car behaves differently. Feel the power and weight, find your balance;
- Customize your cars with exclusive paintjobs, rims, tires and plates;
- Real engine sounds for every car;
- Turbocharger, gearbox and tires sounds;
- Realistic 3D graphics.

If you're a car enthusiast, this game is definitely for you!

70010000085835.description:
Take a ride in a police service vehicle and take your driving skills to the next level, coping with various tasks in difficult conditions.

The game offers many levels, each of which is full of dangerous obstacles and difficult tasks. You will have to maneuver in a limited space, go around obstacles and accurately park a service vehicle, be it a car, a truck or a heavy van. Assess your skills in practice, because the more difficult the level, the higher your demands on attentiveness and driving technique!

Each car has its own characteristics, which requires you to adapt and develop the right strategy for successful parking. Become the best police driver and earn points for quickly and accurately completing tasks. Go through all the tests and discover the secrets of perfect parking!

GAME FEATURES:
• Realistic car physics;
• Many levels with varying difficulty;
• A huge selection of various police vehicles;

70010000086352.description:
Your task is to carefully park large trucks. Each task is a new challenge: you will need to maneuver through narrow passages, avoid obstacles and accurately park your truck in the designated area.

Every situation is unique, and with each level the difficulty increases, forcing you to do everything possible to cope with the task! Parking a large truck is not so easy, especially if it is equipped with a heavy trailer. You will have to show concentration and precision to correctly estimate the distance and turning angle.

Learn to operate heavy equipment and use your skills to avoid penalties for mistakes. In the game you will find different types of trucks and trailers, each of which requires its own approach and driving style. Collect points for fulfilling the conditions and improve your skills, opening new levels and more difficult tasks.

Can you become a master of truck parking? Take the wheel and show other drivers what you are made of!

GAME FEATURES:
• Realistic vehicle control physics;
• Many levels with varying difficulty;
• Large fleet of trucks;

70010000087181.description:
A classic board game with old rules in a new version. Sit down at the tavern table, awaken your strategist skills and outwit your opponent - calculate your opponent's moves, repel the attack and checkmate!

The game allows you to play against a virtual opponent with three difficulty levels, or with your friends right on one device. The rules of the game are simple - you need to clear the chessboard of your opponent's pieces and get to his king. Develop your strategic thinking, improve your skills and become a real chess king!

GAME FEATURES
• A fairly strong virtual opponent with three difficulty levels;
• Nice stylized graphics in a medieval style;
• The ability to play with friends on one device!

70010000087356.description:
This game is an idle RPG for a woodcutter hero who lost his family in the war, but does not despair and helps the inhabitants to survive and rebuild the city after the war. Features in the game:
• Unique mechanics of dismantling the ruins of destroyed houses;
• Chop a tree;
• Build wood, brick and glass processing plants;
• Find residents under the rubble and in the forest, unite them and rebuild the city together;
• No war, only kindness and sympathy!

70010000088196.description:
You find yourself in an enchanted labyrinth of abandoned premises, and the only way to survive is to collect all the notes and find a way to the exit, avoiding a meeting with a dangerous ghost.

Explore the gloomy corridors of abandoned premises, full of dangers and secrets. Each step can lead to new tricks or unexpected finds. Unravel the history of this cursed place, collecting notes left by previous inhabitants.

The atmosphere of the game is filled with tension and fear. Discover dark secrets and show your courage to survive this terrible test. Will you be able to escape from the ghost and unravel the secrets of the abandoned labyrinth?

GAME FEATURES:
• Exciting and dangerous atmosphere;
• An abandoned labyrinth with many secrets;
• Tense and gloomy soundtrack;

70010000092871.description:
Soccer Dash is a casual soccer game where you play as the ball. Aim and control the soccer ball around obstacles and other players trying to obstruct you until the end. The game will go into a slow-motion state when you choose the direction of the kick, so take your time.

Features:
• Developing ingenuity and the right trajectory;
• Novel soccer game full of traps;
• Cool slow-motion effects;
• Fun and creative animations.

70010000093004.description:
The Wild West is full of lazy, no-good-doer cats… That should be lazy and no-good-doing at safe homes instead of wooden venues or the scorching sun outside!

Fill the boots of a local sheriff and spot all the wandering rascals.
(And the not-so-wandering, big and mean rascals, too…)

Game features:
 - 15 levels to look for cats in;
 - 600+ cats to catch;
 - 40+ secret extra items to spot;
 - Mean bosses to cage;
 - Wholesome fun in pretty, handmade locations - with nice music, funny sound effects, and general good humour included :)

70010000093194.description:
Step into the world of Hope's Farm 2, where farming meets puzzle-solving! Help Hope and Noah transform a simple farmland into a thriving paradise. Grow crops, raise charming animals, and decorate your farm to reflect your style.

Sell farm goods through engaging puzzles and earn experience points to unlock exciting new items! With unique quests, adorable animals, and endless customization options, this relaxing yet challenging journey will keep you coming back for more.

Do you have what it takes to make Hope’s dream farm a reality?

Features:
* A Unique Blend of Gameplay: Combine farm simulation with challenging match-3 puzzles;
* Raise Adorable Animals: Welcome cows, alpacas, chickens, and pigs;
* Grow and Harvest Crops: Cultivate strawberries, pumpkins, sunflowers, and more!
* Personalize Your Farm: Use Edit Mode to design your farmland and make it uniquely yours;
* A Charming Storyline: Follow Hope's  journey as she build the farm of her dreams;

70010000093716.description:
A classic board game with an ancient Egyptian flavor and updated rules. Immerse yourself in the atmosphere of the ancient pyramids, where every move is a step towards victory over your opponent. Develop your strategic skills, anticipate your opponent's actions, defend your positions and lead your pieces to victory to checkmate the pharaoh!

In the game, you can fight both with a virtual opponent, who offers three difficulty levels, and with friends on one device. The goal is simple - outwit the enemy, destroy his pieces and seize the throne of the pharaoh. Hone your skills, develop logical thinking and become the greatest strategist of Ancient Egypt!

GAME FEATURES
• A smart virtual opponent with three difficulty levels;
• Unique stylized graphics in the spirit of ancient Egyptian culture;
• The ability to play with friends on one device;

Feel like a real ancient commander and prove that you are worthy of becoming the ruler of Egypt!

70010000094409.description:
You are the naughty cat.

Get ready to cause chaos in Cat From Hell, where you take control of a naughty cat determined to drive Granny crazy! Whether it's eating the fish from the aquarium, breaking flower pots, or throwing random items across the room, Cat From Hell lets you do it all.

Scratch carpets, couches, and any furniture in sight as you explore different rooms filled with destructible objects. With every mess you make, Granny’s patience runs thinner—how far can you push her in Cat From Hell?

Features:
★ Interactive environments full of destructible items;
★ Hilarious reactions from Granny as you wreak havoc;
★ Endless opportunities for mischievous behavior;
★ Simple, fun, and addictive gameplay.

Play Cat From Hell now and start your journey as the ultimate troublemaking cat!

70010000103242.description:
Play as Loki - the fluffiest house defender - and fight off endless pests until your humans return!

Dodge, upgrade, and fiercely survive with your 9 lives and infinite zoomies.

Unlock Lokis from other dimensions, equip useful amulets, and build the weirdest card combos in this chaotic cat roguelike!

Features:
- Flexible gameplay;
- Modifiable round durations and difficulties;
- A variety of character classes;
- Absolute Humour… because that's what happens when you leave your cat unattended!

70010000104722.description:
An evil Lich has tainted Mama Duck’s beloved pond and kidnapped her ducklings!

Arm up and beat him once and for all in this QuackMan roguelite - storm through dungeon mazes to rescue her family!

With classic arcade controls and a twist - an attack button that lets you smash walls and enemies – you’ll fight back against the Lich and his army in no time!

- Forge your own path through the maze;
- Battle massive bosses and fight back a wide variety of undead minions;
- Make animal friends;
- FASHION DUCKS! Compose gear combinations for Mama Duck and her duck-chain!

70010000114622.description:
Re-write your legend through verse and blood, and bring respite to the tragic youth of Kalevala by besting mythical creatures, monsters, spirits - and even Life and Death themselves - in battle.

Perform rituals, navigate treacherous lands, and learn from every misstep to become stronger.

Get roused by:
- Arming up with different weapons, artifacts and poems to craft the perfect build;
- Learning the story of your characters, through besting challenging trials;
- Testing your mettle against epic, old school boss encounters;
- Bits and pieces of genuine finno-karelian legends;
- The dynamic and intense dungeon synth OST!

70010000123772.description:
All heroes got corrupted! Unlock a diverse cast of crafty professionals, use their unique skills, create your own builds and defend your home by eliminating hordes of monsters. Gather materials, rebuild your village and craft your way to the origin of this malignous curse!

UNIQUE BUILDS EVERY STAGE!
Select from a variety of upgrades in this Action Roguelite, to create unique builds catered to each character on each run. Are you going to be a Chef focused on serving deserts or roasting your foes? A Seamstress that will patch your enemies together or massacre them with yarn balls? Which material would you choose for your statues: wood or marble? Find your own crafty way to SURVIVE! 

SELECT YOUR CRAFTER
Choose from a variety of crafters and artisans with their own unique set of skills and mechanics, for different gameplay experiences. Between cooking your enemies, sewing them together or building statues that will crush your foes, there will always be a crafty way to defend your home! 

UPGRADE YOUR VILLAGE AND GET MORE POWERFUL
Gather materials from enemies and use them to upgrade your village, unlocking new characters, extra buffs and grow your power even further. 

CRAFT YOUR OWN WAY TO PLAY
Toggle skills between manual and auto casting individually! Find the ones that work best in each mode, mixing and matching to fit your own playstyle! Everything on manual? All Skills on auto? Or a mix of both? It is up to you! 

• Fight in a diverse set of different biomes, with their own challenges, added through updates; 
• A wide variety of crafters and artisans, with more being added through updates; 
• Different skill trees on each character for you to discover, with over 300 skills available in total; 
• Quick play sessions for busy gamers; 
• Food System allows you to customize your play even further; 
• Smithing and Weaving System bringing over 80 new passive skills to customize each character's playstyle.

70010000125385.description:
Step into a colorful world of creative construction and satisfying 3D puzzles in Legolast Tiny Builder.

Build houses, vehicles, monuments, fantasy objects, and many other detailed creations using hundreds of unique building pieces. Every completed model unlocks new challenges and even more complex constructions to master.

Legolast Tiny Builder combines relaxing gameplay with rewarding puzzle-solving and creative assembly mechanics. Rotate, place, and connect pieces with intuitive controls.

Features:
■ Build detailed 3D models piece by piece;
□ Hundreds of unique construction blocks;
■ Relaxing and satisfying gameplay;
□ Smooth controls;
■ Colorful visuals and immersive sound design;
□ Progressive difficulty from simple builds to advanced constructions;
■ Great for both short sessions and long creative play.

70010000125713.description:
It's time to have a snack at a local Churreria and take a long stroll through Park Güell, because the Hidden Cats have arrived in ever beautiful and sunny Cat-alonia!

The nooks and crannies of Barcelona hide many adorable furballs... Can you spot them all?

On your trip you can - of course - count on:
- 8 beautiful, hand-drawn, real life-inspired levels;
- 800+ hidden cats and objects to spot;
- NEW! Colouring Mode Selection with progressive color reveal for found objects and areas;
- Collectible cards and secrets!

70050000023862.description:
*This item is included in the “Atelier Ryza 2: Lost Legends & the Secret Fairy Digital Deluxe Edition” and “Atelier Ryza 2: Lost Legends & the Secret Fairy Ultimate Edition” sets.

Some of the gathering areas of the previous title “Atelier Ryza” will be unlocked when the story is progressed to a certain point.

Areas featured:
Traveler's Road (from Shipyard);
Pixie Forest (from Flower Guard's Garden);
Maple Delta (from Sweet River);
Weissberg Volcano (from Smoky Mountain Path);
Meteor Castle (from Heatwave Gate).

Note:
- The additional areas will become accessible from a Guideposts in a certain area after you obtain “Compass of Recollection” and return to the Atelier.
- Please visit the official website for more information on the featured content: https://www.koeitecmoamerica.com/ryza2/

70050000025224.description:
This little addition for ATOM RPG is mainly aimed at those, who already own the game, but wish to support our indie studio a bit more nonetheless.

The full list of content is the following:
- Unique camo suit, that changes the way the player character looks and adds to stealth;
- A terrific new NKVD agent's knife;
- New location "Crash site" where new items are found (You recently heard about an old helicopter crash site and decided to check it out);
